(text "POWER. J1 battery in (BAT_IN; NO on-board fuse: installer fits an external fuse <=10 A standard (non-time-delay), >=58 V DC in the battery lead) -> SMDJ40CA -> LM74800 + 2x BSC070N10NS5 back-to-back (VBAT_P).\nOV trip 36.35-40.06 V (38.18 V typ, 1 % parts), release 33.19-36.65 V (35.04 V typ), UV 5.65V/5.18V (210k/49.9k/8.66k, 1.231/1.13V thresholds; fall/UV INFERRED). LM5176 buck-boost -> +12V (FB 140k/10k, RT 27.4k ~300kHz, 8mR sense).\nTPS56637 -> +5V (FB 75k/10k = 5.1V, 3.3uH). TPS56637 -> +3V3 from +12V (FB 45.3k/10k, 3.3uH L3, 3x22u), >=3A. MODE open = FCCM.\nSAFE DOMAIN: LMR36506 buck VBAT_P -> +3V3_BK (EN = R1125/R1126 divider from VBAT_P: on above 3.6-4.25 V; held off with U2 by the Q2 hold-off, Pass 6); TPS2116 priority mux VIN1=+3V3 / VIN2=+3V3_BK -> +3V3_SAFE (MCU, FRAM, WDT, I/O, E-stop logic)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f9037049-4ffd-4e63-91b5-1304f620589c"))
(text "EXT FUSE <=10 A STANDARD (NON-TIME-DELAY), >=58 V DC" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35.56 287.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (thickness 0.3) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "143c99bf-7918-4634-825b-8c7c9ff9c1b6"))
